# Jill, Shiva's Dominant: "{3}{U}{U}, {T}: Exile Jill, then return it to the battlefield transformed ... Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 3 Bot1 has
# the mana (Black Lotus, Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet) but casts an Ornithopter first: with it on the stack the ability is refused (CR 307.5); once it
# resolves it is paid. Shiva's chapter I, Mesmerize, makes the Memnite unblockable: Bot2's Ornithopter may not block it (CR 509.1b), so the
# Memnite connects for 1 and Bot2 is at 19.

